      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200601011/2006010110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？　あぁ……\r\nはは、俺も休みだったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006010110020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "休日を忘れるだなんて\r\n私を心配させたいのかい？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601011/2006010110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そういうつもりじゃないんだ\r\nしっかり休ませてもらうよ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0220"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
